{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o178b","title":"曹操获承制封拜权","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o178b-account","label":"正文","text":"天子令曹操承制封拜诸侯、守相。","evidence":["wudi-e-o178b-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-p124a-account","label":"孔衍《汉魏春秋》","text":"《汉魏春秋》所载诏书说明为使军中赏罚及时，许曹操临事刻印封拜，不必等候诏命。","evidence":["wudi-e-p124a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0054","role":"授权","evidence":["wudi-e-o178b-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"获授权","evidence":["wudi-e-o178b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安二十年九月","year":215,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o178b-q","wudi-q-o173","wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab"],"chronology":"wudi-y215","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o173","basis":"建安二十年九月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1000,"O178b"],"order":378}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0054","name":"汉献帝","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o178b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-0d8ae785c96f5f9a0693","layer":"original","quote":"天子命公承制封拜诸侯、守相〖18〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":324,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":62,"end":80},{"id":"wudi-e-p124a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-74e80424946809e6f8e4","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞孔衍《汉魏春秋》曰：“天子以公典任于外，临事之赏，或宜速疾；乃命公得承制封拜诸侯、守相。诏曰：‘夫军之大事，在兹赏罚；劝善惩恶，宜不旋时。故《司马法》曰“赏不逾日”者，欲民速睹为善之利也。昔在中兴，邓禹入关，承制拜军祭酒李文为河东太守；来歙又承制拜高峻为通路将军。察其本传，皆非先请；明临事刻印也。斯则世祖神明，权达损益，盖所用速示威怀而著鸿勋也。其《春秋》之义，大夫出疆，有专命之事，苟所以利社稷安国家而已。况君秉任二伯，师尹九有，实征夷夏；军行藩甸之外，失得在于斯须之间；停赏俟诏以滞世务，固非朕之所图也。自今以后，临事所甄，当加宠号者，其便刻印章假授。咸使忠义得相奖励，勿有疑焉。’”","attribution":"孔衍《汉魏春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3811469134f5df136f23","start":0,"end":298},{"id":"wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215 ）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":328,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3bb2f11071aab1690790","start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wudi-q-o173","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fc2c779b81f1c3c13b40","layer":"original","quote":"二十年春正月〖1〗，天子立公中女为皇后〖2〗。省云中、定襄、五原、朔方郡〖3〗，郡置一县领其民；合以为新兴郡〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
